    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθο-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing flowers, flowery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλσος</span>”
