					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					445
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.256
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρπιμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
